{"id":"n87667-2-7","stage":4,"title":"홍색 · 鲜红色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87667-2-7-1","ko":"신부의 한복 치마가 참 예쁘네.","zh":"新娘的韩服裙子真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신부의","meaning":"新娘，新娘子","explanation":"신부：新娘，新娘子；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"신부","audio":"/audio/2ec5f43408d90211d6d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65342","senseId":"1","lemma":"신부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신부의","audio":"/audio/ad62012cf987f98564f1.mp3"}},{"text":"한복","meaning":"韩服","explanation":"한복：韩服","readings":[{"term":"한복","audio":"/audio/2674925563130f0470ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48061","senseId":"1","lemma":"한복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한복","audio":"/audio/2674925563130f0470ef.mp3"}},{"text":"치마가","meaning":"裙，裙子","explanation":"치마：裙，裙子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"치마","audio":"/audio/b967dea5488a0b55846e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57331","senseId":"1","lemma":"치마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치마가","audio":"/audio/a46dfbb7dd3632e4f920.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘네.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘네","audio":"/audio/9a0e7362fe217b57c0e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2ec5f43408d90211","term":"신부","zh":"新娘，新娘子","audio":"/audio/2ec5f43408d90211d6d3.mp3","entryId":"65342","definition":"现在刚结婚或正结婚的女子。","pronunciation":["신부"]},{"id":"2674925563130f04","term":"한복","zh":"韩服","audio":